@startuml
title Idempotency V1.1 - L1 普通 execute() 判定状态

hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

state "Repository\nAtomic Decision" as DECISION <<choice>>
state "ACQUIRED\n创建/滚动为 PROCESSING" as ACQUIRED
state "SUCCESS\n→ REPLAYED" as SUCCESS
state "PROCESSING_ACTIVE\n未超时" as ACTIVE
state "PROCESSING_EXPIRED\n已超时" as EXPIRED
state "FAILED_RETRYABLE\n可恢复失败" as RETRYABLE
state "FAILED_FINAL\n最终失败" as FINAL
state "KEY_CONFLICT\nkey 被不同 route/hash 复用" as CONFLICT

[*] --> DECISION : tryAcquire()
DECISION --> ACQUIRED : ABSENT\n或 SHORT_TERM window 已结束
DECISION --> SUCCESS : persisted=SUCCESS
DECISION --> ACTIVE : PROCESSING\nnow < processingExpireAt
DECISION --> EXPIRED : PROCESSING\nnow >= processingExpireAt
DECISION --> RETRYABLE : FAILED\nfailureRetryable=true
DECISION --> FINAL : FAILED\nfailureRetryable=false
DECISION --> CONFLICT : routeKey/requestHash mismatch

ACQUIRED --> [*] : callback 执行
SUCCESS --> [*] : 返回历史结果
ACTIVE --> [*] : 返回 PROCESSING
EXPIRED --> [*] : 返回 PROCESSING_EXPIRED
RETRYABLE --> [*] : 返回 PREVIOUS_FAILED_RETRYABLE
FINAL --> [*] : 返回 PREVIOUS_FAILED_FINAL
CONFLICT --> [*] : 返回 KEY_CONFLICT

note bottom of EXPIRED
NORMAL execute() 只做判断：
不 mark FAILED，不自动接管。
end note

note bottom of RETRYABLE
“可恢复”不等于“普通请求立即重试”。
真正接管由 recover() 完成。
end note

@enduml
